    "body": "## Problem\n\nWhen a server sends `workspace/inlayHint/refresh`, all inlay hints get cleared right away and only come back once the new response is drawn. rust-analyzer sends refresh after almost every change, so hints flicker while typing.\n\n## Solution\n\nOn refresh, cancel the in-flight request and mark the current result stale, but leave the extmarks alone. `on_win` already clears the namespace when the new result is drawn. Empty responses now take the same path, so stale hints still go away when the server returns none.\n\nFixes #42212\n",
    "closed_at": "2026-10-31T11:09:49Z",
